1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
National Radio and Television Administration.

2
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,280
Mr. Zhao, I've left Honghu.

3
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,120
You know, before Dingfei,

4
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,640
wasn't I always in charge?

5
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,160
Would you consider

6
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,290
working with me personally this year?

7
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,200
Come visit my law firm first.

8
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:42,400
Xiao Li,

9
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,280
that SUV of mine

10
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,480
hasn't been sold yet.

11
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,930
Then lower the price a bit more.

12
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,780
I need the money urgently.

13
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,680
Mr. Zhang, you mentioned before

14
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,480
that you needed a new corporate counsel.

15
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,340
Let's chat when you have a chance.

16
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:57,690
Yes, on the second floor of that bathhouse on Lawyer Street.

17
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,090
Sister Pang,

18
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,440
I parked the car at the door for you.

19
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:00,880
Okay.

20
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,440
Keys.

21
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:02,120
Okay.

22
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:26,080
The second floor of this bathhouse has changed hands.

23
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,800
Xiao Longnv,

24
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,500
did she run out of an ancient tomb?

25
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,479
She legitimately came from Honghu.

26
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,960
Aren't they all elites in Honghu?

27
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,759
What is she doing in this corner?

28
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:36,960
Sister Long.

29
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,600
First-hand news.

30
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,840
When we came to look at the place,

31
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,920
wasn't the law firm diagonally across

32
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,280
about to close down?

33
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,200
They took a big case a couple of days ago

34
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,640
and are completely revived.

35
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,280
Really?

36
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,560
If you ask me,

37
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,680
the feng shui of our Lawyer Street

38
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,640
is quite good.

39
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,920
Except for the bathhouse downstairs,

40
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,920
which is damp and noisy.

41
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,479
Brother,

42
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,840
I'll get you some vinegar.

43
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,240
Let's do a vinegar scrub.

44
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,280
Miaomiao,

45
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,360
don't blame me for saying this,

46
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,820
but you still need to grow.

47
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,120
Your vision,

48
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,640
you need to look further ahead.

49
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,480
Just look over here.

50
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:04,920
Come,

51
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,260
look over here.

52
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,120
Do you know what this beautiful scene

53
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,240
is called?

54
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:11,760
What?

55
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,200
This is called

56
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,880
Rising Justice.

57
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,680
Right?

58
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,480
Once we open the window,

59
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:20,480
the feng shui flows in.

60
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,480
Cases will keep coming in,

61
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:24,200
and business will boom.

62
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,640
Come in.

63
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:43,920
Director.

64
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,160
Lawyer Shen.

65
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:45,600
Here you go.

66
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,160
Come on.

67
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,160
Mr. Zhao from Dingfei

68
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,600
called me this morning

69
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,440
and said

70
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,920
he would renew the contract with us.

71
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,600
I know Mr. Zhao well.

72
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,060
We've had a couple of meals together.

73
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,160
Lawyer Li was just promoted to senior partner,

74
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,400
so he's too busy.

75
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,160
He can manage.

76
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,640
I remember

77
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:08,160
Xiao Longnv used to be in charge of Dingfei.

78
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,380
It might be inconvenient for you.

79
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,440
It's very convenient for me.

80
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:17,040
I really admire Lawyer Li's vision.

81
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:19,360
Willing to sacrifice, knowing when to let go,

82
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,840
and not clinging to old ties.

83
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,440
By the way,

84
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,480
I heard

85
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,840
that Xiao Longnv started

86
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,160
her own law firm.

87
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,040
Is that so?

88
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:32,600
Sister,

89
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,720
will this work?

90
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,840
What do you mean?

91
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,440
Of course it will.

92
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,920
Have you ever heard the saying,

93
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,520
"bottom out and bounce back"?

94
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,600
We are bouncing back right now.

95
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,320
Understand?

96
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:43,960
Understood.

97
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,240
What we have now

98
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,680
is a standard comeback script.

99
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,450
Understood.

100
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,160
Miao'er.

101
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:51,120
Are you ready to play?

102
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,280
Start playing.

103
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,720
Play.

104
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:53,400
Hello.

105
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,079
You can consult me if you have any legal questions.

106
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:56,320
Xiao Longnv Law Firm.

107
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,840
But Xiao Longnv

108
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,120
has always been quite unique.

109
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,780
So many lawyers are dying to get into our Honghu.

110
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,880
But look at her.

111
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,600
Honghu used to

112
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,360
protect her too well.

113
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,940
She should suffer a bit

114
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,340
and change her temper.

115
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,960
She needs to experience

116
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,900
the hardships of society.

117
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,360
Hello.

118
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,760
You can consult me if you have any legal questions.

119
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,959
Xiao Longnv Law Firm.

120
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,120
Sister Hu.

121
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,720
That matter from last time is easy to settle. Come, come.

122
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,320
Come in and chat. Come, come.

123
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,040
Lawyer Xiao.

124
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,360
The company has decided to renew the contract with Honghu.

125
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,040
As you know,

126
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,780
Mr. Zhao values brand and reputation very much.

127
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,330
He heard that when you left,

128
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,960
you had an unpleasant falling out with Honghu.

129
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,080
Director.

130
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,760
I remember when I first joined,

131
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,960
you taught us

132
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,280
that a lawyer's sword...

133
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,680
You must swing it for the shieldless.

134
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,240
Your understanding of law and justice

135
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,880
is too superficial.

136
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,120
Think carefully

137
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,600
about what kind of lawyer

138
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,920
you really want to be.

139
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:51,920
It's okay.

140
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,240
It's okay.

141
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,680
You lost the labor arbitration

142
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,680
because of insufficient evidence, understand?

143
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,120
I don't even know if you worked there or not.

144
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,360
How can I help you?

145
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,800
I really worked there.

146
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,680
I didn't lie to you.

147
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,600
Don't touch me.

148
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,400
I'm warning you.

149
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,040
If you touch me again,

150
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,960
I'll sue you for picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

151
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,290
I'll have you arrested, believe it or not?

152
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,120
Then please have mercy

153
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,640
and refund my money.

154
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:17,520
Then you'll be charged with extortion.

155
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,640
That's all the money I have left.

156
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,000
Refund my money.

157
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,000
You're doing this again, huh?

158
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,880
I'm warning you.

159
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,400
This has nothing to do with me.

160
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,280
You're trying to scam me.

161
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,400
I'm acting in self-defense.

162
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,960
Bro, you're pretty tough.

163
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,720
Did you get your law license from a driving school?

164
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,840
Waving your arms around to scare people.

165
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,720
Don't be afraid. He's lying to you.

166
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,480
Wait, who are you?

167
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,159
Does this have anything to do with you?

168
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:40,040
Since I saw it,

169
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,960
it has something to do with me.

170
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,720
You learned a little law,

171
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,280
and you're just throwing accusations around.

172
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:44,960
Fine.

173
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,159
I don't have time to waste

174
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:46,800
with you women here.

175
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:49,360
What era is this? Still sexist?

176
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,800
What happened? Tell me.

177
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:02,200
I haven't had time to buy a coffee table yet.

178
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,760
Have some.

179
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,000
Go ahead.

180
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,850
They're for guests anyway.

181
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,760
It's delicious.

182
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:21,880
I worked at that restaurant

183
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,640
for over five months.

184
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:24,810
Waiting tables,

185
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,760
serving food,

186
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,560
washing dishes,

187
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,000
I had to do everything.

188
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,860
At first, they gave me 2,000 yuan,

189
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,800
but in the end, they didn't pay me anything

190
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,460
and said I didn't do anything.

191
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:35,580
Did you sign an employment contract?

192
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,440
Nothing at all.

193
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,640
Do you have any clock-in records

194
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:39,000
or attendance records?

195
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:40,640
None of those?

196
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,880
Then, um,

197
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,560
how much are the legal fees?

198
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,520
The money I finally managed to save

199
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,880
was all taken by that lawyer.

200
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,320
You don't need to worry about that.

201
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,780
We can apply for legal aid.

202
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,080
It means

203
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,640
you don't have to pay the legal fees.

204
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,840
The legal aid center will subsidize me.

205
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,120
When you go back, find the neighborhood committee

206
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,780
and get a certificate of financial difficulty.

207
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,960
Thank you, Ms. Lawyer.

208
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:14,560
Thank you, Ms. Lawyer.

209
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,020
You're like a sister to me.

210
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:19,720
Okay, okay.

211
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,380
I'll get it for you right away.

212
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,200
Ladies.

213
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,080
What would you like to eat?

214
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:24,680
Where is Wu Lian?

215
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,810
Tell her to come out.

216
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,480
Who?

217
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,840
We don't have anyone by that name here.

218
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,520
Wu Lian owes my sister money.

219
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:31,760
I must see her today

220
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,360
and make her pay it back.

221
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,600
Did you make a mistake?

222
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,440
There really is no such person.

223
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:36,159
She sent my sister photos of your shop.

224
00:07:36,159 --> 00:07:37,080
How could I be mistaken?

225
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,010
Here, the photo.

226
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,180
I remember her.

227
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,440
Wu Lian, right?

228
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,440
She came to me looking for a job around the New Year.

229
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,080
I thought I'd let her give it a try.

230
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,040
But as soon as she started,

231
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,400
she broke several plates.

232
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:47,600
I kicked her out that very day.

233
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,520
Kicked her out?

234
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,360
Stop acting.

235
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:51,490
She was still working here last month.

236
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,240
Little girl,

237
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,500
society is dangerous.

238
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,040
You need to be more careful.

239
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,360
Don't call me sister.

240
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,000
I'm not your sister.

241
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,080
Are you hiding in the kitchen,

242
00:07:59,080 --> 00:07:59,600
Wu Lian?

243
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,160
You are Wu Lian, right?

244
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,160
You've got the wrong person.

245
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,160
I'm not Sister Lian.

246
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,760
Hurry up and wipe the tables.

247
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,240
Miss,

248
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,640
I didn't lie to you, did I?

249
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,840
I told you there's no one named Wu Lian here,

250
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,300
but you didn't believe me.

251
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,480
I'm sorry, boss.

252
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:13,440
I'm sorry.

253
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:14,840
Look at you.

254
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,650
Look at what you did to the shop.

255
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:18,320
You should have asked first.

256
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,040
I did it all? You didn't do anything?

257
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,400
I'm sorry, sir.

258
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,400
May your business prosper, boss.

259
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,000
Let's go.

260
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:31,080
It seems the boss has definitely silenced the employees.

261
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:32,280
Even with witnesses,

262
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,480
we still need sufficient objective evidence

263
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,440
to be more certain.

264
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,039
But Sister Lian has nothing.

265
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,980
Existence always leaves a trace.

266
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,799
There must be something we haven't thought of.

267
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,020
Where's the money?

268
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:59,880
I... I found another lawyer.

269
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,170
What's the use of finding a lawyer?

270
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,320
Didn't I tell you

271
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,050
that I need the money urgently?

272
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:11,920
It's an honor to learn from you.

273
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,210
It's just a meeting.

274
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,920
This is making me nervous.

275
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:18,480
Mr. Li.

276
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,760
This is Su Bowen, who just joined our team.

277
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,360
Ding Chao.

278
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,080
Lawyer Li,

279
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,880
it's your honor to learn from me.

280
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,960
I... I... I mean,

281
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,840
my honor.

282
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,560
Lawyer Li,

283
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,600
I'm so happy to be chosen by you.

284
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:30,880
Really,

285
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,400
I've always thought you're very stylish.

286
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,060
You're handsome and capable.

287
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:34,960
As for me,

288
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,520
I have a Level 2-B in Mandarin,

289
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:37,520
