472
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,680
I don't owe her any money.

473
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,560
Don't listen to her nonsense.

474
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,640
What's going on?

475
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,280
Didn't we file a case for her?

476
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:25,100
Why did she go make a scene at the restaurant?

477
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,760
What did the boss say?

478
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:40,820
The boss won't pay.

479
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,280
