482
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,800
How did you get this?

483
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:59,560
The boss pushed me, and I lost my balance.

484
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:01,680
I hit the corner of the table.

485
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,600
Daughter,

486
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,680
