487
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,360
Useless.

488
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,520
You only got 200 yuan.

489
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:52,850
What is that enough for?

490
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,600
There's an old saying in China: a son pays his father's debts.

491
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,360
You know?

492
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,360
Even if I die,

493
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:02,220
