494
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:07,480
Right.

495
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,119
Didn't you find a little lawyer?

496
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:13,050
Ask her to give you the money first.

497
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,119
Just make up a lie.

498
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:16,599
Say you need money for medical treatment urgently.

499
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,720
Just ask her to lend you some money first.

500
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,250
Let's go.

501
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,000
I'm not going. I'm not going.

502
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,440
I'm not going. I'm not going.

503
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:24,099
Are you rebelling against me?

504
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:28,800
Come with me.

505
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:29,320
My cup.

506
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:31,040
Get out of my way.

507
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:33,130
Try touching her again.

508
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:33,920
Who are you?

509
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:35,320
None of your business.

510
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,440
Are you okay?

511
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,320
Ms. Lawyer,

512
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:38,050
