513
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,760
You're that little lawyer, right?

514
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:42,920
I'm here,

515
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,560
teaching my daughter a lesson.

516
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,280
Is it any of your business?

517
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,280
It is my business.

518
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:47,760
It's still illegal for a father to beat his daughter.

519
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:48,440
Did you know that?

520
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:50,040
Don't talk nonsense with me here.

521
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:51,440
Believe it or not, if you piss me off,

522
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,520
I'll slap you too.

523
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,280
Slap me and see.

524
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,520
I'll call the police immediately,

525
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:56,280
and sue you for picking quarrels and provoking trouble, and intentional injury.

526
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:57,320
Are you going to slap me or not?

527
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,250
Come on, slap me.

528
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:59,040
Slap me!

529
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,640
You're out of line.

530
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,170
Let's go.

531
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,800
Get out of the way.

532
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:12,760
Come on.

533
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:14,480
Thank you, Miss Lawyer.

534
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,060
Does it still hurt?

535
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,160
Not anymore.

536
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,520
Tell me the truth.

537
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:22,450
These injuries,

538
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,080
did your dad do this?

539
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,520
He's a gambling addict

540
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:29,280
and owes a lot of money.

541
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,040
He took

542
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:32,320
all my money.

543
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,440
If I don't have money for him,

544
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:36,880
he makes me stage accidents.

545
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:39,760
Eating glass shards hurts so much.

546
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,480
Then,

547
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,060
