548
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,280
I can't run.

549
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:55,240
If I run, I'll become a fugitive.

550
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,200
What fugitive?

551
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,460
What law did you break?

552
00:18:57,760 --> 00:18:59,760
