553
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:02,040
A son must pay his father's debts.

554
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:05,170
Who told you that a son paying his father's debts is a law?

555
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:06,960
He did.

556
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,520
He's lying to you.

557
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,280
Unless he dies,

558
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,760
