559
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:15,280
and then use it to pay his debts.

560
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:17,280
R-Really?

561
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,570
Of course it's true.

562
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:21,100
Do you believe what a lawyer like me says,

563
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:22,440
