564
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:24,240
I-I believe you.

565
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,520
I don't want to pay his debts for him.

566
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:30,920
I want to go somewhere far, far away.

567
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:34,000
So he can never find me.

568
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:35,920
I'll save up

569
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,760
all the money I earn from working.

570
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,240
I'll rent a small place.

571
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:43,960
I'll have hot water for showers.

572
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:45,160
And...

573
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,090
I'll have apples to eat.

574
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:50,800
