909
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:29,160
Aren't you fit for battle?

910
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:30,400
Go march back.

911
00:31:31,120 --> 00:31:31,780
How can I...

912
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:35,160
You have to drop me off.

913
00:31:35,800 --> 00:31:37,800
Is this how you treat the elderly?

914
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:40,280
Where did you leave me?

915
00:31:42,080 --> 00:31:43,210
Where is this place?

916
00:31:43,560 --> 00:31:45,040
Where are you now?

917
