950
00:32:35,520 --> 00:32:36,760
Just curse at him.

951
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:37,280
Curse.

952
00:32:37,280 --> 00:32:38,280
Curse at him hard.

953
00:32:38,520 --> 00:32:38,920
Curse.

954
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:42,400
Cursing is easy.

955
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,040
Exactly.

956
00:32:43,040 --> 00:32:43,700
