972
00:32:59,040 --> 00:33:00,320
My sister is inspired. You do it.

973
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:01,380
You do it. You type.

974
00:33:01,520 --> 00:33:02,640
Then may he

975
00:33:02,640 --> 00:33:04,280
