976
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,960
Why would you even give him a meat bun?

977
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:07,600
Let him eat stinky tofu and stink to death.

978
00:33:07,600 --> 00:33:09,760
We shouldn't even give him stinky tofu.

979
00:33:09,760 --> 00:33:10,520
I work all day,

980
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:11,320
