983
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:14,760
People line up to buy it.

984
00:33:14,760 --> 00:33:16,120
Let's go eat it together someday.

985
00:33:16,120 --> 00:33:17,720
Still thinking about stinky tofu, you really...

986
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:18,800
I really love eating stinky tofu.

987
00:33:18,800 --> 00:33:20,000
The more you eat, the better it tastes.

988
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:22,120
I'll treat everyone when I get paid.

989
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:26,340
The boss replied, 'How dare you curse at me?'

990
00:33:28,600 --> 00:33:29,240
Well,

991
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,520
she cursed at me first.

992
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:33,040
I remember now.

993
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,560
You're the woman who came to my shop

994
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:35,760
