1001
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:44,800
In the past six months,

1002
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:47,080
there were 108 reviews

1003
00:33:47,080 --> 00:33:48,440
with photos on the app.

1004
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:48,920
Among them,

1005
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:50,360
16 photos

1006
00:33:50,360 --> 00:33:51,800
