1010
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:00,360
My client

1011
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:02,170
works hard without complaint.

1012
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:04,460
These hands of hers

1013
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:06,160
are the proof of her hard work.

1014
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:07,680
Proof of self-reliance.

1015
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:12,520
There are many women like Wu Lian.

1016
00:34:13,199 --> 00:34:15,520
Limited by their upbringing,

1017
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,420
