1028
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:39,860
where the child pays the father's debts,

1029
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:42,650
using family ties to emotionally blackmail her.

1030
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:45,639
Her unscrupulous boss would take advantage of her vulnerability

1031
00:34:45,639 --> 00:34:47,920
to ruthlessly exploit her labor.

1032
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,639
At times like this,

1033
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:52,400
