1034
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:54,199
She can only endure it.

1035
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,440
But is that right?

1036
00:34:58,160 --> 00:34:59,400
I want to tell them

1037
00:35:01,200 --> 00:35:02,000
