1038
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:05,240
can be their support.

1039
00:35:05,560 --> 00:35:06,720
Plaintiff's counsel.

1040
00:35:06,720 --> 00:35:07,760
Let's try to

1041
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:09,600
