1042
00:35:09,600 --> 00:35:11,200
Sorry, I couldn't hold back.

1043
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:14,160
According to the Labor Contract Law of the People's Republic of China,

1044
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:16,000
According to Article 82,

1045
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:19,040
if no labor contract is signed,

1046
00:35:19,160 --> 00:35:21,680
the employer must pay double wages

1047
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,360
starting from the second month.

1048
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:25,200
Therefore, we request

1049
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:28,720
that the defendant pay 8,000 yuan according to this law,

1050
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:31,120
plus 10,000 yuan for five months of unpaid wages,

1051
00:35:31,120 --> 00:35:33,360
and compensation for illegal termination

1052
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,200
