1053
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:34,880
totaling

1054
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:36,080
20,000 yuan.

1055
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:46,240
Here.

1056
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:48,320
This one is a bit different

1057
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:49,120
