1066
00:36:03,040 --> 00:36:03,840
Go ahead.

1067
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,680
Don't miss your train.

1068
00:36:04,680 --> 00:36:05,160
Okay.

1069
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:06,160
Go back.

1070
00:36:07,520 --> 00:36:08,160
Goodbye.

1071
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:16,440
I also want to go to a place far, far away.

1072
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,130
I will save up

1073
00:36:18,560 --> 00:36:21,000
