1077
00:36:29,120 --> 00:36:29,920
That's great.

1078
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:33,160
Sister Lian can finally go to the place she wants to go.

1079
00:36:33,640 --> 00:36:34,440
So, Sister,

1080
00:36:34,600 --> 00:36:36,440
