1087
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:50,600
That's a big city.

1088
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,840
Indeed.

1089
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:54,560
Let's go. Let's go back to our big law firm.

1090
00:36:54,560 --> 00:36:55,520
Let's go.

1091
00:36:56,160 --> 00:36:56,680
Sister,

1092
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:57,760
I feel we are much freer now

1093
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:59,480
than when we were in Honghu.

1094
00:36:59,720 --> 00:37:01,120
