1095
00:37:01,120 --> 00:37:01,880
Of course.

1096
00:37:04,240 --> 00:37:07,170
Thanks to Lawyer Li for the farmers' issue this time.

1097
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:08,160
It's my duty.

1098
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:09,680
This way of handling it

1099
00:37:09,680 --> 00:37:10,800
