1104
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:19,360
Thank you, Mr. Wan.

1105
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:19,960
Okay.

1106
00:37:20,080 --> 00:37:22,140
Here's to a successful partnership.

1107
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:22,810
Okay.

1108
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:36,400
Lawyer Li.

1109
00:37:42,560 --> 00:37:43,160
Lawyer Li.

1110
00:37:43,160 --> 00:37:44,640
My classmate said Xiao Longnü handed out business cards

1111
00:37:44,640 --> 00:37:45,640
