I advise you not to get any ideas either.

1141
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,640
According to industry rules,

1142
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:58,680
we can't represent both the plaintiff and the defendant at the same time.

1143
00:38:58,680 --> 00:38:59,880
If you want to take it,

1144
00:39:00,200 --> 00:39:02,000
you should resign voluntarily.

1145
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:03,160
I gotta go.

1146
00:39:12,080 --> 00:39:12,720
I am Li Xin.

1147
00:39:14,200 --> 00:39:16,640
We at Wangang will fully cooperate with you.

1148
00:39:16,640 --> 00:39:17,240
Director,

1149
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:18,880
I have something to tell you.

1150
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:23,120
Master.

1151
00:39:23,560 --> 00:39:25,760
I took over Mr. Pan's case first.

1152
00:39:26,040 --> 00:39:27,440
He exploited a loophole in the process

1153
00:39:27,440 --> 00:39:29,280
and got it approved before me.

1154
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:29,920
I request

1155
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,560
that his approval be withdrawn.

1156
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:34,090
There's no company rule against expediting.

1157
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:36,760
Have the farmers paid their legal fees?

1158
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:39,240
I took it on a contingency basis.

1159
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:42,360
Whose risk?

1160
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:48,960
Director.

1161
00:39:50,720 --> 00:39:52,450
I remember when I first joined,

1162
00:39:52,600 --> 00:39:53,880
you taught us

1163
00:39:55,160 --> 00:39:56,360
that a lawyer's sword

1164
00:39:56,600 --> 00:39:58,680
should be wielded for the defenseless.

1165
00:39:58,680 --> 00:40:01,080
Those farmers really have nowhere to turn.

1166
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:02,160
Shouldn't we

1167
00:40:02,160 --> 00:40:03,560
stand with them?

1168
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:04,640
Xiaolong.

1169
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:07,410
Your understanding of law and justice

1170
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:08,920
is too superficial.

1171
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:12,120
I trained both of you myself.

1172
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,760
At critical moments,

1173
00:40:14,200 --> 00:40:15,860
you need to take a longer view.

1174
00:40:16,200 --> 00:40:17,530
This matter is settled.

1175
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:19,200
Go back and calm down.

1176
00:40:19,800 --> 00:40:20,960
Think carefully

1177
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,840
about what kind of lawyer

1178
00:40:23,080 --> 00:40:24,280
you really want to be.

1179
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:28,160
It's settled, right?

1180
00:40:32,640 --> 00:40:33,370
Understood.

1181
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:36,200
Director.

1182
00:40:37,800 --> 00:40:38,640
I resign.

1183
00:40:39,120 --> 00:40:39,760
Lao Pan.

1184
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:42,680
The paperwork for my new law firm has come through.

1185
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:43,720
I'm dropping

1186
00:40:45,160 --> 00:40:45,960
this lawsuit.

1187
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:49,280
I've already agreed to their settlement terms.

1188
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,080
Lawyer Li said

1189
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:54,040
this kind of lawsuit could take years.

1190
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:55,280
If we lose,

1191
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:57,600
we won't get a single penny.

1192
00:40:57,800 --> 00:41:00,480
Now Wangang has agreed to give each household 300,000

1193
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:03,200
to buy our dead fish and shrimp.

1194
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:04,530
Although it's not much,

1195
00:41:04,800 --> 00:41:07,880
we all owe bank loans.

1196
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:11,240
We really can't hold on anymore.

1197
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:13,840
Attorney Xiao, I'm sorry.

1198
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:24,640
The problem has been solved.

1199
00:41:24,640 --> 00:41:25,970
Let's go back to Honghu.

1200
00:41:26,120 --> 00:41:27,980
Did you really solve the problem?

1201
00:41:28,600 --> 00:41:31,080
You just got rid of the people who raised it.

1202
00:41:31,720 --> 00:41:33,520
Addressing demands in the shortest time,

1203
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:35,000
resolving conflicts at the lowest cost,

1204
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:36,480
and saving social resources.

1205
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:37,410
Isn't that good?

1206
00:41:37,680 --> 00:41:38,880
What about the facts?

1207
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:40,120
What about the truth?

1208
00:41:40,960 --> 00:41:43,200
Did Wangang admit to what they did?

1209
00:41:43,560 --> 00:41:45,890
Will the pollution issue just be ignored?

1210
00:41:46,680 --> 00:41:47,640
You just blindly

1211
00:41:47,640 --> 00:41:49,280
use money to shut them up.

1212
00:41:50,560 --> 00:41:51,200
Li Xin.

1213
00:41:51,960 --> 00:41:53,520
Do you think this is fair?

1214
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:56,480
I understand the fairness you want,

1215
00:41:56,680 --> 00:41:58,320
but you can't ignore the cost,

1216
00:41:58,320 --> 00:42:00,250
let alone gamble with your future.

1217
00:42:01,200 --> 00:42:01,800
Xiaolong,

1218
00:42:03,120 --> 00:42:04,000
we are friends.

1219
00:42:05,200 --> 00:42:07,730
I sincerely hope you think it over carefully.

1220
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:12,090
I am officially informing you,

1221
00:42:14,360 --> 00:42:15,680
from now on,

1222
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:19,680
we are no longer friends.

1223
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:45,520
100 minus.
